    <section id="sc_what_is_max_protec" class="what_is_max_protec section-content">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-5 col-lg-5 pad-top-4-mob">
                    <img alt="What is ICICI Lombard MaxProtect" title="MaxProtect health insurance policy" class="img-responsive img_pdt" src="/docs/default-source/assets/max-protect/images/what_is_max_protec.svg">
                </div>
                <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-8 col-lg-8">
                    <h2 class="text-left">What is ICICI Lombard's MaxProtect health insurance policy with 1 crore<sup>U</sup> sum insured?</h2>
                    <p>ICICI Lombard’s MaxProtect Health Insurance with ₹1 Crore sum insured is designed to eliminate financial worries when it comes to healthcare. Imagine accessing quality medical care for yourself and your loved ones without ever being concerned about hospital bills or treatment limits.</p>
                    <p class="pad-top2">
                        The 1 crore Health Insurance plan goes beyond standard benefits like in-patient hospitalisation and daycare coverage by also providing global medical coverage, ensuring peace of mind even outside India. With unlimited reset of sum insured, free teleconsultations, and assured private rooms, the policy ensures uninterrupted access to the best treatment facilities.
                    </p>
                    <p class="pad-top2">
                       The 1 Cr. Medical Insurance is further strengthened with cashless claim settlement across a vast hospital network, round-the-clock assistance, and tax savings under Section 80D. With ICICI Lombard MaxProtect, you get comprehensive protection against medical inflation, ensuring your family’s health is always secure.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-content why-is-1cr-plan-needed">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-8 col-lg-8">
                    <h2 class="pd-mob-40 text-left">Why is 1 crore health insurance plan needed?</h2>
                    <div class="number-tab-list">
                        <div class="number-list-container">
                            <div class="num_holder">
                                1
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <p><b>Medical inflation</b></p>
                                <p>Healthcare costs are soaring, and a 1 crore insurance cover provides a substantial financial cushion to confidently manage the high expenses associated with quality medical treatment.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="number-list-container">
                            <div class="num_holder">
                                2
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <p><b>Lifestyle diseases</b></p>
                                <p>
                                    With lifestyle diseases becoming increasingly common, such as diabetes, heart disease, and obesity, a 1 crore insurance cover ensures comprehensive coverage for these conditions. You can face these health
                                    challenges head-on, knowing that your insurance will provide the necessary financial support for treatments and long-term management post a waiting period.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="number-list-container">
                            <div class="num_holder">
                                3
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <p><b>Sufficient coverage</b></p>
                                <p>
                                    By choosing a high SI, you can rest assured that, regardless of the cost of treatment, your <a href="https://www.icicilombard.com/health-insurance" title="" class="" target="_blank">health insurance</a>&nbsp;coverage will be more than sufficient. Whether it's major surgery, critical illness, or
                                    emergency medical care, the range ensures that you have adequate funds to meet the cost of treatment.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-4 col-lg-4 text-center pad-top-4-mob">
                    <img class="img-responsive" title="ICICI Lombard Max Protect Health Insurance" alt="why_is_1cr_ins_plan_needed" src="/docs/default-source/assets/max-protect/images/why_is_1cr_ins_plan_needed.svg">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

