                <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-4 col-lg-4">
                    <div class="common-insurance-blocks pad-block1">
                        <em>1</em>
                        <h4>Extensive coverage</h4>
                        <p>
                            Get complete protection against various medical expenses with a health plan offering a 1 crore sum insured.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-4 col-lg-4">
                    <div class="common-insurance-blocks pad-block1">
                        <em>2</em>
                        <h4>No coverage limit worries</h4>
                        <p class="more">
