                </div>
                <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-4 col-lg-4">
                    <div class="common-insurance-blocks pad-block1">
                        <em>3</em>
                        <h4>Access to top healthcare</h4>
                        <p class="more">
                            Access the best healthcare services without financial concerns. Choose renowned hospitals and doctors without compromising on quality.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="clearfix">&nbsp;</div>
                <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-4 col-lg-4">
                    <div class="common-insurance-blocks pad-block1">
                        <em>4</em>
                        <h4>Coverage for various medical expenses</h4>
                        <p>
                           MaxProtect includes coverage for in-patient and daycare treatments, pre and post-hospitalisation expenses, domiciliary care, technological advancements and treatments, donor expenses, and even road and air ambulance services.
                        </p>
