                        <div class="common-insurance-blocks pad-block1">
                            <em>6</em>
                            <h4>Reset Benefits<sup>S</sup></h4>
                            <p>MaxProtect also provides unlimited sum insured reset benefits<sup>s</sup> for any illness or injury, ensuring ongoing support for your medical needs.</p>
