                        </div>
                        <h3>Pre and Post-Hospitalisation Coverage</h3>
                        <p>It includes coverage for medical expenses incurred before and after hospitalisation, such as diagnostic tests, medications, and follow-up consultations.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="clearfix"></div>
                <div class="paraHide">
                    <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-4 col-md-4 col-lg-4">
