                            </div>
                            <h3>Worldwide Coverage Option</h3>
                            <p>The premium plan covers medical treatment &amp; day care hospitalisations worldwide<sup>T</sup> after the waiting period.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-4 col-md-4 col-lg-4">
                        <div class="common-insurance-blocks pad-block2">
                            <!-- <em>6</em> -->
                            <div class="img-section-h">
