                                                <ul class="clearfix ui-check-list exclusion-tabs green_tick read_show">
                                                    <li>
                                                        <p>
                                                            Pre-existing diseases and their direct complications are excluded until 36 months of continuous coverage. Opt for the pre-existing disease waiver add-on to reduce it to 24 months.
