    <section class="section-content max-protect-coverage-good-fit">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-5 col-lg-5 text-center pad-top-4-mob">
                    <img class="img-responsive" title="ICICI Lombard Max Protect Health Insurance" alt="ICICI Lombard MaxProtect health insurance coverage is a good fit if" src="/docs/default-source/assets/max-protect/images/isolation_mode.svg">
                </div>
                <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-7 col-lg-7">
                    <h2 class="pd-mob-40 text-left">ICICI Lombard's MaxProtect health insurance coverage is a good fit if</h2>
                    <div class="number-tab-list">
                        <div class="number-list-container">
                            <div class="num_holder">
                                1
                            </div>
                            <p>You're a health-conscious individual who values well-being and financial security during medical emergencies.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="number-list-container">
                            <div class="num_holder">
                                2
                            </div>
                            <p>
                                You or your family members have pre-existing conditions, as MaxProtect offers extensive coverage after the waiting period.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="number-list-container">
                            <div class="num_holder">
                                3
                            </div>
                            <p>You're seeking coverage &amp; access to a list of modern treatments and advanced medical procedures.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="number-list-container">
                            <div class="num_holder">
                                4
                            </div>
                            <p>You are a frequent international traveller or have family members who live abroad and can benefit from global coverage.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="number-list-container">
                            <div class="num_holder">
                                5
                            </div>
                            <p>You're looking for a no-tension extensive health benefits policy that includes daycare treatments, pre and post-hospitalisation expenses, in-patient AYUSH treatments, and more for you and your family.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-content bg-lightblue" id="WhyICICILombard">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-7 col-lg-7 ui-onlinetext-dth">
                    <h2 class="text-left">ICICI Lombard's MaxProtect optional add-ons</h2>
                    <p>MaxProtect offers optional add-ons to enhance your health insurance coverage. Here are the add-ons available:</p>
                    <h3 class="head-text">Pre-existing disease waiting period reduction</h3>
                    <p>
                        This add-on reduces the waiting period for pre-existing diseases and their complications from 36 to 24 months. If you increase your sum insured, the exclusion will apply to the additional coverage.
                    </p>
                    <!-- <p class="pad-top1">
                        Suppose you have continuously been covered without any break per the portability norms of IRDAI (Health Insurance) Regulations. In that case, we will reduce the waiting period for specific conditions to the extent of
                        your prior coverage. This ensures faster coverage for specific conditions.
                    </p>
                    <h3 class="head-text">Room upgrade (Classic plan only)</h3>
                    <p>With this add-on, you can upgrade your room category to any room in a hospital except a suite. This means you can enjoy the benefits of a higher-category room for your hospital stay.</p> -->
                </div>
                <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-5 col-lg-5 text-center ui-onlineimg-dth">
                    <img alt="MaxProtect optional add-ons" title="ICICI Lombard MaxProtect optional add-ons" class="img-responsive img_pdt" src="/docs/default-source/assets/max-protect/images/max-protect-add-ons.svg">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-content">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-xs-12 text-center">
                    <h2>Steps to claim one crore health insurance</h2>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="row">
                <div class="div-holder pad-top2">
                    <div class="pink-gradient-box">
                        <div>
                            <p class="claim-guarantee">Claim guarantee for reimbursement &amp; cashless claims</p>
                            <!-- <p>Get reimbursement accepted claims paid within 14 days of submitting all the required claim documents or get paid 2% interest over and above the rate defined per IRDAI (Protection of Policyholder's Interest) Regulations 2017.</p> -->
                            <p class="gradient-txt">For cashless hospitalisation, get a response from us within 2 hours of raising the pre-authorisation request at our network hospitals.</p>
                        </div>
                        <img alt="Steps to claim one crore health insurance" src="/docs/default-source/assets/max-protect/images/step_to_claim.svg" class="responsive">
                    </div>
                    <div class="accordion-wrapper">
                        <div class="accordion-card accordion-filled">
                            <div class="accordion-title">
                                <h3>Planned Cashless Everywhere hospitalisation</h3>
                            </div>
                            <div class="accordion-panel">
                                <p class="pad-bottom2">Follow the below steps to avail of Cashless Everywhere hospitalisation in hospital outside out network:</p>
                                <div class="number-list-container">
                                    <div class="num_holder">
                                        1
                                    </div>
                                    <p>Inform us before hospitalisation: For a planned hospitalisation, inform us at least 24 hrs. prior. Use the IL Take Care app to tell us you plan to get hospitalised.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="number-list-container">
                                    <div class="num_holder">
                                        2
                                    </div>
                                    <p>Choose Cashless Everywhere: Inside the IL Take Care app, select the Services we offer tab and choose the Health Assistance option for Cashless Everywhere.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="number-list-container">
                                    <div class="num_holder">
                                        3
                                    </div>
                                    <p>Easy discharge: Once your treatment is done, you can leave the hospital without paying any money at the time of discharge, based on the terms and conditions of your insurance policy.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-card accordion-filled">
                            <div class="accordion-title">
                                <h3>Planned hospitalisation in network hospital</h3>
                            </div>
                            <div class="accordion-panel">
                                <div class="number-list-container">
                                    <div class="num_holder">
                                        1
                                    </div>
                                    <p>Check if the hospital is on the empanelled list of network hospitals.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="number-list-container">
                                    <div class="num_holder">
                                        2
                                    </div>
                                    <p>Submit the pre-authorisation form and relevant documents to your insurance provider a few days before the hospitalisation.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="number-list-container">
                                    <div class="num_holder">
                                        3
                                    </div>
                                    <p>Get treated</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="number-list-container">
                                    <div class="num_holder">
                                        4
                                    </div>
                                    <p>
                                        Our claims officer reviews the documents submitted by the hospital while you are being treated. These include discharge summaries, hospital bills, pharmacy bills, investigation reports, payment
                                        receipts and doctor's consultation papers. They may request a few more relevant documents if required.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="number-list-container">
                                    <div class="num_holder">
                                        5
                                    </div>
                                    <p>Easy discharge</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="number-list-container">
                                    <div class="num_holder">
                                        6
                                    </div>
                                    <p>The claim, if approved, is settled by us directly. All you need to do is sign the relevant papers before getting discharged.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="note-div">
                                    <div class="num_holder pad-bottom1">
                                        Note:
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="number-list-container">
                                        <div class="num_holder">
                                            1
                                        </div>
                                        <p>
                                            If your claim is not approved - you may still complete your treatment. You must clear the hospital dues and may apply for a reimbursement claim. Also, remember to obtain your original documents
                                            from the hospital.
                                        </p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="number-list-container">
                                        <div class="num_holder">
                                            2
                                        </div>
                                        <p>If a query is raised - by the insurance company, you may need to follow up with them and submit relevant/additional documents required for processing the claim.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-card accordion-filled">
                            <div class="accordion-title">
                                <h3>Emergency cashless hospitalisation</h3>
                            </div>
                            <div class="accordion-panel">
                                <p class="pad-bottom2">Follow the below steps to avail of Cashless Everywhere hospitalisation in hospital outside out network:</p>
                                <div class="number-list-container">
                                    <div class="num_holder">
                                        1
                                    </div>
                                    <p>Emergency: In an emergency, head directly to the nearest network hospital for treatment.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="number-list-container">
                                    <div class="num_holder">
                                        2
                                    </div>
                                    <p>Cashless hospitalisation: Once you're at the hospital - Show your e-health card and government recognised ID proof at the hospital TPA (Third Party Assistance) desk and leave the rest to us.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="number-list-container">
                                    <div class="num_holder">
                                        3
                                    </div>
                                    <p>
                                        The TPA will submit a pre-approval request for cashless hospitalisation to us for further processing, which has a turnaround time of 60 minutes from receipt of complete documents, on best effort
                                        basis. Please note you may have to pay for non-medical expenses not covered in your policy.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="number-list-container">
                                    <div class="num_holder">
                                        4
                                    </div>
                                    <p>
                                        Company review: We will review the hospital bills after providing provisional cashless authorisation while you get treatment. The claim, if approved, is settled by us directly. All you need to do is
                                        sign the relevant papers before getting discharged.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-card accordion-filled">
                            <div class="accordion-title">
                                <h3>Process for reimbursement claims</h3>
                            </div>
                            <div class="accordion-panel">
                                <p class="pad-bottom2">For reimbursement claims under MaxProtect health insurance of 1 crore, follow these steps:</p>
                                <div class="number-list-container">
                                    <div class="num_holder">
                                        1
                                    </div>
                                    <p>Notify us: Inform us about the claim through our toll-free 24x7 helpline 1800 2666 or website, providing policy details and the nature of the claim.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="number-list-container">
                                    <div class="num_holder">
                                        2
                                    </div>
                                    <p>Submit documents: Prepare and submit the necessary documents, including claim forms, medical records, bills, discharge summaries, and prescriptions.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="number-list-container">
                                    <div class="num_holder">
                                        3
                                    </div>
                                    <p>File the claim: Submit the form and documents to the online claim portal.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="number-list-container">
                                    <div class="num_holder">
                                        4
                                    </div>
                                    <p>Claim verification: We will review the documents and may seek additional information if needed.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="number-list-container">
                                    <div class="num_holder">
                                        5
                                    </div>
                                    <p>Claim settlement: Once verified, we will process the claim as per policy terms.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="number-list-container">
                                    <div class="num_holder">
                                        6
                                    </div>
                                    <p>Reimbursement or cashless settlement: Depending on your reimbursement preference, you'll receive a refund, or we will directly settle the bill with the hospital through the cashless facility.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

